Source: mhvtl
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Maarten Jacobs <maarten256@outlook.com>
Build-Depends:
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 zlib1g-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: mhvtl
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
 sg3-utils, mhvtl-dkms
Recommends: mt-st, lsscsi
Description: Virtual tape library for Linux
 mhvtl provides a SCSI-based virtual tape library
 used for testing backup and archival software.

Package: mhvtl-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends:
 dkms,
 linux-headers-generic | linux-headers,
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: DKMS kernel module for mhvtl
 This package provides the mhvtl kernel module
 built via DKMS for the running kernel.
